{
  "_comment": [
    "Griffin Fund meeting theme. The palette is Select Equity Group's, sampled",
    "from selectequity.com: #00549e primary, #6cace4 light, #e1ecf8 wash,",
    "#f4f2ec cream paper, #3e3e3e ink.",
    "",
    "SEG's own site is blue type on cream. That reads beautifully for the",
    "welcome and prejoin screens and is what we use there. It does not work",
    "behind live video, where a light UI makes every face look washed out and",
    "the eye fights the screen for an hour. So the in-call chrome is a deep",
    "navy mixed at the same hue as #00549e, and the blue stays the accent.",
    "Same family, different room.",
    "",
    "Keys come from jitsi-meet's colorMap. Anything not listed keeps the",
    "Jitsi default, so adding a key here is safe but removing one is not."
  ],

